## GCP and staging

See `.cursor/rules/gcp-and-staging-workflow.mdc`: use GCP CLI for deploys and DB operations; run `npm run test:regression:staging` after staging-related changes; do not ask the user to run commands the agent can run via CLI.

## Regression Testing Commands

After any code change, run regression tests:
```bash
npm run test:regression:staging   # Test against staging
npm run test:regression:prod      # Test against production
```

